{"seq":3,"slug":"low-power-design","title":"低功耗设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/low-power-design","wordCount":718,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"低功耗设计\">低功耗设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>低功耗设计是电池供电和能量收集（Energy Harvesting）设备的核心需求。嵌入式系统的功耗由动态功耗（开关活动）和静态功耗（漏电流）两部分组成。通过硬件选型、时钟管理、电源域控制和软件优化的协同，可以将系统平均功耗从毫安级降低到微安甚至纳安级，实现数年的电池续航。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[低功耗设计策略] --&gt; B[硬件层]&#10;    A --&gt; C[系统层]&#10;    A --&gt; D[软件层]&#10;    B --&gt; E[低功耗 MCU 选型]&#10;    B --&gt; F[外设电源管理]&#10;    C --&gt; G[时钟门控]&#10;    C --&gt; H[电压调节]&#10;    C --&gt; I[睡眠模式]&#10;    D --&gt; J[任务调度优化]&#10;    D --&gt; K[唤醒策略]&#10;    D --&gt; L[数据批处理]\">graph TD\n    A[低功耗设计策略] --&gt; B[硬件层]\n    A --&gt; C[系统层]\n    A --&gt; D[软件层]\n    B --&gt; E[低功耗 MCU 选型]\n    B --&gt; F[外设电源管理]\n    C --&gt; G[时钟门控]\n    C --&gt; H[电压调节]\n    C --&gt; I[睡眠模式]\n    D --&gt; J[任务调度优化]\n    D --&gt; K[唤醒策略]\n    D --&gt; L[数据批处理]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>功耗来源</th>\n<th>典型值</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n<th>节省比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CPU 运行</td>\n<td>10-100mA</td>\n<td>降频、睡眠</td>\n<td>90%+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Flash 读取</td>\n<td>5-20mA</td>\n<td>从 RAM 执行</td>\n<td>50-70%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外设运行</td>\n<td>1-50mA</td>\n<td>时钟门控、断电</td>\n<td>80-99%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IO 驱动</td>\n<td>0.1-10mA</td>\n<td>降低驱动强度</td>\n<td>50-80%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏电流</td>\n<td>0.1-10μA</td>\n<td>低功耗模式</td>\n<td>变量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无线通信</td>\n<td>10-300mA</td>\n<td>占空比控制</td>\n<td>95%+</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mcu-低功耗模式\">MCU 低功耗模式</h2><p>现代 MCU 提供多级低功耗模式，在唤醒速度和功耗之间做权衡：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// STM32L4 低功耗模式&#10;void enterSleepMode(void) {&#10;    HAL_SuspendTick();&#10;    HAL_PWR_EnterSLEEPMode(PWR_MAINREGULATOR_ON, PWR_SLEEPENTRY_WFI);&#10;    HAL_ResumeTick();&#10;}&#10;&#10;void enterStopMode(void) {&#10;    HAL_SuspendTick();&#10;    __HAL_RCC_PWR_CLK_ENABLE();&#10;    HAL_PWREx_EnterSTOP2Mode(PWR_STOPENTRY_WFI);&#10;    SystemClock_Config();&#10;    HAL_ResumeTick();&#10;}&#10;&#10;void enterStandbyMode(void) {&#10;    __HAL_RCC_PWR_CLK_ENABLE();&#10;    HAL_PWR_EnableWakeUpPin(PWR_WAKEUP_PIN1);&#10;    __HAL_PWR_CLEAR_FLAG(PWR_FLAG_WU);&#10;    HAL_PWR_EnterSTANDBYMode();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// STM32L4 低功耗模式</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enterSleepMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_SuspendTick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_PWR_EnterSLEEPMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PWR_MAINREGULATOR_ON, PWR_SLEEPENTRY_WFI);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_ResumeTick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enterStopMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_SuspendTick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __HAL_RCC_PWR_CLK_ENABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_PWREx_EnterSTOP2Mode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PWR_STOPENTRY_WFI);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    SystemClock_Config</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_ResumeTick</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enterStandbyMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __HAL_RCC_PWR_CLK_ENABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_PWR_EnableWakeUpPin</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PWR_WAKEUP_PIN1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    __HAL_PWR_CLEAR_FLAG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(PWR_FLAG_WU);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">    HAL_PWR_EnterSTANDBYMode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>功耗 (STM32L4)</th>\n<th>唤醒时间</th>\n<th>保持内容</th>\n<th>唤醒源</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Run (80MHz)</td>\n<td>~8mA</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low-Power Run (2MHz)</td>\n<td>~33μA</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sleep</td>\n<td>~1mA</td>\n<td>~1μs</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>任何中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Low-Power Sleep</td>\n<td>~8μA</td>\n<td>~10μs</td>\n<td>全部</td>\n<td>任何中断</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop 0</td>\n<td>~1.3μA</td>\n<td>~5μs</td>\n<td>SRAM + 寄存器</td>\n<td>RTC/GPIO/UART</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop 1</td>\n<td>~0.6μA</td>\n<td>~10μs</td>\n<td>SRAM + 寄存器</td>\n<td>RTC/GPIO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stop 2</td>\n<td>~0.3μA</td>\n<td>~20μs</td>\n<td>SRAM</td>\n<td>RTC/GPIO</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Standby</td>\n<td>~0.03μA</td>\n<td>~50μs</td>\n<td>备份寄存器</td>\n<td>RTC/WKUP 引脚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shutdown</td>\n<td>~0.01μA</td>\n<td>~100μs</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>WKUP 引脚</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"时钟与外设管理\">时钟与外设管理</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 动态时钟调整：根据负载切换频率&#10;void setHighPerformance(void) {&#10;    RCC_ClkInitTypeDef clkInit = {0};&#10;    clkInit.ClockType = RCC_CLOCKTYPE_SYSCLK;&#10;    clkInit.SYSCLKSource = RCC_SYSCLKSOURCE_PLLCLK;&#10;    HAL_RCC_ClockConfig(&amp;clkInit, FLASH_LATENCY_4);&#10;}&#10;&#10;void setLowPower(void) {&#10;    RCC_ClkInitTypeDef clkInit = {0};&#10;    clkInit.ClockType = RCC_CLOCKTYPE_SYSCLK;&#10;    clkInit.SYSCLKSource = RCC_SYSCLKSOURCE_MSI;&#10;    HAL_RCC_ClockConfig(&amp;clkInit, FLASH_LATENCY_0);&#10;    HAL_RCCEx_MSIRangeConfig(RCC_MSIRANGE_4);&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 外设时钟门控：不用的外设关掉时钟&#10;__HAL_RCC_USART2_CLK_DISABLE();&#10;__HAL_RCC_SPI1_CLK_DISABLE();&#10;__HAL_RCC_ADC_CLK_DISABL